== Notes ==
* Item pools can be exhausted by having the game create every item in that specific pool. Items do not need to be picked up for this to happen, the game simply has to generate them (rerolling the item with {{i|The D6}} for example).
** When an item pool is exhausted, the game will generate items from the Treasure Room pool instead.
** If the Treasure Room pool is exhausted, the only item that can be generated from it is {{i|Breakfast}}.
* Even though you technically cannot see items during [[Curses#Curse of the Blind|Curse of the Blind]], their weights are still being reduced upon encountering them.
** {{dlc|r}} The same applies to blind items in alternative chapters.

